      "writtenOn": "2020-11-24T19:06:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this case we were trying to make of the upstream `gen_mod_rs` flag which generates a meta-module containing all the generated protos in order to allow grpc + protobuf code to find each other. That flag needs to see all the protos. See b/172952239 for additional context. We could possibly fake this with additional in-Soong code generation, but that feels rather hackish.",
      "parentUuid": "64181940_94cdf945",
      "revId": "78c2eaebc142243a1f47b8a2131a0bbe78bdf0b0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
