      "writtenOn": "2020-11-24T21:06:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Pretty much what Matthew says. We could continue to emulate the gen_mod_rs flag by maintaining our own codegen that produces the meta module; that would allow us to process the proto files independently. But we\u0027d like to move away from doing our own codegen here if possible.",
      "parentUuid": "6b0602f8_1af539df",
      "revId": "78c2eaebc142243a1f47b8a2131a0bbe78bdf0b0",
